> What is the difference between MC and MR? I haven't been able to
> understand from reading about it in "Maniac's Ascension Guide".

They are confusing.  The rule of thumb version (only rule of thumb, not
exact) is that MC affects many of the extra effects from hand-to-hand
combat attacks.  Like being bitten by were-monsters, being
bitten/touched by monsters that drains levels, etcs, while MR affects a
set of effects, like death effects, polymorph effects, etcs whether
they are from melee attacks, from traps, from rays, etcs.

However, that's just a rule of thumb.  If you really want to know, you
sort of just have to have a list of 'what having MC prevents, and what
having MR prevents'.

